  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 103.25 Household infectious waste",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 103.25 “Household infectious waste” means infectious waste generated from non-commercial medical treatment of individuals in personal residences, such as needles from self-administered insulin treatments.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 103.21) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
